<title>USA: TABLE - Conestoga Enterprises Q2 net flat.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Conestoga Enterprises Q2 net flat.</headline>
<dateline>BIRDSBORO, Pa. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.36		    $0.42</p>
<p> Net			    1.8			1.8</p>
<p> Revs			  13.7			9.5</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     4.6			4.3</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.80		    $0.92</p>
<p> Net			    3.9			3.7</p>
<p> Revs			  25.9		     18.2</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     4.5			4.0</p>
<p>(All data above in millions except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Conestoga Enterprises Inc said it paid a preferred dividend of $168,000 in the second quarter and in the first six months of 1997.</p>
<p>Net income was calculated before the payment of preferred dividends, earnings per share were calculated after the payment of preferred dividends.</p>
<p>The company said its earnings per share were lower because of shares it issued in association with acquisitions in 1996 and 1997.</p>
